WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.097
These days

2
00:00:01.097 --> 00:00:03.886
the things that matter most can get pushed

3
00:00:03.886 --> 00:00:06.674
aside by the unrelenting tasks we all face.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.822
School emails.

5
00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:09.744
Work commitments.

6
00:00:09.744 --> 00:00:10.667
Prescription refills.

7
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.817
Where does spending more quality time together fit in?

8
00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:16.659
Meet Symphony

9
00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:19.028
the friendly family assistant that connects what matters

10
00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:21.990
in your life with what you need to do today.

11
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:26.284
It helps sort through scattered emails

12
00:00:26.284 --> 00:00:26.793
notes

13
00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:27.810
and commitments

14
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.844
identify what needs attention

15
00:00:29.844 --> 00:00:32.386
and suggest practical next steps.

16
00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:34.421
You decide what matters.

17
00:00:34.421 --> 00:00:37.980
Symphony helps you get ready to act.

18
00:00:39.233 --> 00:00:41.688
Want more quality time as a family?

19
00:00:41.688 --> 00:00:44.494
Symphony helps turn that intention into a plan:

20
00:00:44.494 --> 00:00:46.247
two family walks this month

21
00:00:46.247 --> 00:00:48.001
dates to make them happen

22
00:00:48.001 --> 00:00:50.456
and a simple next step—choose a trail.

23
00:00:51.775 --> 00:00:54.952
Need to call the pharmacy about a missing medication?

24
00:00:54.952 --> 00:00:57.070
Add it straight to today’s list.

25
00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.247
Symphony’s AI can help gather a verified phone number

26
00:01:00.247 --> 00:01:00.953
medication details

27
00:01:00.953 --> 00:01:02.012
and previous notes

28
00:01:02.012 --> 00:01:04.483
so you’re ready to make the call.

29
00:01:05.817 --> 00:01:08.738
It all comes together on one daily page:

30
00:01:08.738 --> 00:01:10.563
what you’ve chosen to do

31
00:01:10.563 --> 00:01:13.484
with the information you need to do it.

32
00:01:14.733 --> 00:01:15.703
Big goals

33
00:01:15.703 --> 00:01:16.673
everyday responsibilities

34
00:01:16.673 --> 00:01:18.613
and unexpected demands—all connected

35
00:01:18.613 --> 00:01:22.493
so you can spend less time keeping track

36
00:01:22.493 --> 00:01:24.433
and more time living.

37
00:01:25.692 --> 00:01:26.035
Symphony.

38
00:01:26.035 --> 00:01:27.754
Make room for what matters.
